===Etymology 1===
From {{inh|en|enm|don}}, {{m|enm|idon}}, {{m|enm|ȝedon}}, {{m|enm|gedon}}, from {{inh|en|ang|dōn}}, {{m|ang|ġedōn}}, from {{inh|en|gmw-pro|*dān}}, from {{inh|en|gem-pro|*dēnaz}} (past participle of {{m|gem-pro|*dōną|t=to do}}). Equivalent to {{suffix|en|do|en}}. Cognate with {{cog|sco|dune}}, {{m|sco|deen}}, {{m|sco|dene}}, {{m|sco|dane|t=done}}, {{cog|stq|däin|t=done}}, {{cog|fy|dien|t=done}}, {{cog|nl|gedaan|t=done}}, {{cog|nds-de|daan|t=done}}, {{cog|de|getan|t=done}}. More at {{l|en|do}}.

